    <task id="LOCAL-00007" summary="feat(hypothesis): add dynamic tool catalog discovery and tool-aware generation&#10;&#10;Introduce `retrieve_validation_tools` — a new FunctionTool that queries&#10;the FedotMAS MCP RAG database for available validation tools before&#10;hypothesis generation. The tool catalog flows through the entire pipeline:&#10;&#10;- `models.py`: `ValidationToolInfo`, `ToolCatalog` models; `tool_catalog`&#10;  on `HypothesisQuery`; `validation_tool_matching` on `Hypothesis`&#10;- `generator_agent.py`: `_retrieve_validation_tools` tool registered&#10;  BEFORE `_generate_via_moosechem`; catalog injected via state&#10;- `tool_registry.py`: `discover_validation_tools()` — FedotMAS RAG query&#10;  with static fallback to chemical-mcp-server tools&#10;- `prompts.py`: GENERATOR_INSTRUCTION gains Step 0 workflow + Tier 1/2/3&#10;  prioritization (testable / reformulatable / needs-new-tools)&#10;- `moosechem_tool.py`: `_format_tool_catalog()` renders catalog into the&#10;  LLM generation prompt&#10;- `moosechem_mcp_tool.py`: `_match_tools()` fuzzy-matches hypothesis tools&#10;  against catalog, populates `validation_tool_matching`&#10;- `loop_coordinator.py`: refinement prompt considers tool input constraints&#10;- `critic_agent.py`: 5-dimensional scoring (+tool_coverage); relaxed passing&#10;  threshold: sum ≥ 6/10 AND min ≥ 1 → approve">
